<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Happiness We Deserve</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Once the fighting across Etheria finally came to an end, Adora immediately threw herself into the efforts to rebuild her war-torn planet. Since Horde Prime's defeat, she and Catra have had only rare moments alone together, but when the most urgent projects finally reach their completion, there's time for everyone to stop and celebrate. To commemorate the rebellion's victory, a lively party is held in Bright Moon's courtyard.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When Catra sneaks away from the celebration, Adora follows, and they find themselves alone in their shared room at Bright Moon. For the first time in Adora's life, she can slow down and evaluate where their relationship stands. She can find out where she and Catra want it to go. And now Adora may finally be able to share the passion that she's been so desperate, but nervous, to reveal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Essentially, this is an extremely self-indulgent, detailed, and long-winded account of Adora and Catra's first time.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>RadiantKay</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
